      "message": "Please review this code section: https://github.com/ffilz/nfs-ganesha/blob/next/src/Protocols/NFS/nfs4_Compound.c#L754-L758.\n\nBefore the QoS metrics are initialized, the QoS implementation jumps to the code at the above lines. In the function qos_process_iops(), it calls one of these functions: qos_process_iops_pe(), qos_process_iops_pc(), or qos_process_iops_pepc(). If you look at the changes in these functions, you\u0027ll notice that updates are being made to metric values that haven’t actually been created yet. Using the enabled_metrics configuration, we can determine whether the metric creation has been completed or not.",
